<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5951" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cachrys</span></b> , yos,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάχρυς ʽκάγχρυς</span>).
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An appendage to the catkin of certain trees in
				autumn</i>, <i>a cone</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 16, 8,
				11, § 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 5,
			18</span></i>, n. 5; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">admixta cachry,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 22, 32, § 71</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">27, 13, 109,
				§ 134</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The capsule of rosemary</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24,
				11, 60, § 101</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>The white kernel of the plant</i> crethmos, <i><span class="en">Plin. 26, 8,
				50, § 82</span></i>.</div>
